config BR2_PACKAGE_DMESG_TOOL
	bool "dmesg-tool"
	help
	  Real util-linux 2.40.2 dmesg (static), from
	  prado-firmware-reconstruction's tools/dmesg/ -- richer than
	  BusyBox's built-in applet (-T human timestamps, -x facility/
	  level decode, --color). Named dmesg-tool (not "dmesg") to avoid
	  any Kconfig-symbol collision with BusyBox's own dmesg applet
	  option.
